    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Legendary Patsy Cline Show! Starring Amberley Beatty and the Sweet Dreams!<br aria-hidden=true /><br aria-hidden=true />When Amberley Beatty steps on to the stage, the spirit, and the very soul of one of the greatest singers in the history of pop and country music comes to life. From the classic western style, to the stunning evening gown, complete with the bright red lipstick, she embodies the sultry sound of the legendary Patsy Cline.<br aria-hidden=true /><br aria-hidden=true />So here begins this magical ride; expect to sing along, laugh, and at times be brought to tears by this very special performance. From chart busters like I Fall To Pieces, She&#8217;s Got You, Crazy and the bone chilling Faded Love, all the hits of the one and only Patsy Cline are featured in this incredible show. Get ready to go Walking After Midnight with Amberley Beatty in the legendary Patsy Cline show!\nYour health and safety is a priority when visiting our venues.<a href=https://lighthousetheatre.com/covid/> Click here to see our COVID-19 Duty of Care. </a>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
