        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Adapted and directed by Marcus Lundgren\nYou&#8217;ll be hooked when Peter Pan and the Lost Boys fly onto the Lighthouse Theatre stage! Wendy Darling doesn&#8217;t want to grow up and leave her brothers, John and Michael, in the nursery. So when the dashing Peter Pan drops by in search of his shadow, the three children jump at the chance to fly with him to Never Land, a magical place where they will never grow old. There they meet the menacing Captain Hook, his gang of silly pirates, and one very hungry crocodile. Will Peter, Tinker Bell, and the children outduel the pirates and save Never Land? Pack your pixie dust and follow the second star to the right for a swashbuckling adventure sure to delight the whole family!\nTickets $12 each or $40 for a group of four\nAuditions for Young Company are happening June 8th! <a href=https://lighthousetheatre.com/young-company/>Click here to learn more</a>\nYour health and safety is a priority when visiting our venues.<a href=https://lighthousetheatre.com/covid/> Click here to see our COVID-19 Duty of Care. </a>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
