      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Queen has always been the fairest in the land. Her Magic Mirror tells her so! But when the Queen hears that Snow White has surpassed her, she’s willing to do whatever it takes to get rid of her… forever! Fortunately, Snow White escapes into the Deep Dark Woods, where she chances on a tiny cottage. Little does she know that the Seven Dwarves living there will help save her! The classic story of our heroine, as she encounters hapless Huntsmen, bad apples, and little men with big hearts and short tempers, comes to life as DuffleBag helps Snow White towards her happily ever after!\nThis is an interactive performance! Audience members of all ages are encouraged to dress up as their favourite fairy tale character and some audience members may be brought up on stage to be a part of the story!\n"
      }
    ]
  },
