      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Adapted and directed by Marcus Lundgren\nAfter coming home to England, Robin of Loxley learns that the vile Sheriff of Nottingham has seized his family’s property while impoverishing villages with brute force and greed. Armed with arrows and dubbed Robin Hood, Loxley bands together with Friar Tuck, Little John and a group of rowdy rebels with a plan to rob the fiendish Sheriff of his money and power and return it all to the people.\nTickets $15 each or $50 for a group of four!\n"
      }
    ]
  },
