    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class=page title=Page 1>\n<div class=section>\n<div class=layoutArea>\n<div class=column>\n<strong><em>*WORLD PREMIERE*</em></strong>\nRobert and Jeff are middle-class suburbanites who figure they can use a little extra cash to improve their troubled lives. No problem. They devise a plan whereby they will steal a thoroughbred racehorse and hold it for ransom. They enlist the aid of Padre, an experienced criminal, and a pair of bumbling twins named Chip and Dale. What can go wrong? Just about everything in A Pack Of Thieves.\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
