        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class=page title=Page 1>\n<div class=section>\n<div class=layoutArea>\n<div class=column>\nTo share the Opry&#8217;s history is to share the story of Country Music. Leisa Way and her phenomenally talented Wayward Wind Band raise the roof with the hottest country songs from the last few decades. Sing-a-long to Johnny Cash, Shania Twain, Vince Gill, Loretta Lynn, Patsy Cline, Lady A, Kenny Rogers, Dolly Parton, Tammy Wynette, George Jones, Garth Brooks, Tim McGraw, Faith Hill, Hank Williams, Glen Campbell, Taylor Swift, Gretchen Wilson, Flatt &amp; Scruggs, Ricky Scaggs, Hank Snow, and more!\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
