        "@id": "_:g1245860"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://lighthousetheatre.com/event/the-magic-of-hope-with-lucas-wilson/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Magic of Hope with The Illusionist Lucas Wilson"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "World renowned Illusionist Lucas Wilson is returning to perform at Port Dover’s Lighthouse Theatre on January 20, 2024, for an afternoon and evening performance.\nLucas will bring both his magic, award-winning illusions and his Guinness World Records feats to the stage in support of Tumaini Children’s Foundation!\nTumaini Children’s Foundation is a non-profit registered charity dedicated to the care, support, and education of orphaned and vulnerable children near Usa River, Tanzania. Visit our website at <a class=ms-outlook-linkify href=http://www.tumainimeanshope.org/ data-ogsc=>www.tumainimeanshope.org</a> to find out more. Tumaini means HOPE in Swahili and with hope everything is possible!\nThe magic continues after the show with an interactive magic workshop with Lucas. Learn how to perform your very own magic at home in this LIMITED VIP ONLY workshop.\nJoin the limited VIP experiences which includes:\n-30-minute interactive magic workshop\n-Autographed Poster\n-Souvenir Lanyard\n-Seats within the first 2 rows\nBring the whole family as Lucas Wilson dazzles you with The Magic of Hope in support of Tumaini Children’s Foundation.\nGive the gift of time together this upcoming holiday season! Give the gift of HOPE!\n"
      }
    ]
  },
