    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://lighthousetheatre.com/event/the-country-legends-garth-brooks-shania-twain/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Country Legends(Garth Brooks, Shania Twain)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "BACK BY POPULAR DEMAND. THE BEST IN COUNTRY TRIBUTES. FEATURING A TRIBUTE TO GARTH BROOKS AND SHANIA TWAIN.\n<strong>Garth Brooks &#8211; Les Smith</strong>\nLes Smith is from the beautiful village of Mitchell Ontario. He looks and sounds so much like Garth that many who have seen the show say they forget they are watching a tribute band. Les says he heard how much he looks like Garth for years, especially after he cut his hair and put on a cowboy hat when he began playing country music almost fourteen years ago. He was performing Garth’s songs casually with five band members until he was approached by an agent who encouraged him to develope the act and take it on the road as a tribute to Garth. He have performed over a thousand shows throughout the United States and Canada for over 20 years.\n<strong>Shania Twain &#8211; Donna Huber</strong>\nThe Shania Twain tribute band, starring Donna Huber as &#8220;Shania Twin,&#8221; is a captivating musical experience that pays homage to the iconic Canadian country pop artist, Shania Twain. Donna Huber, the talented performer and singer, embodies the spirit and style of Shania Twain, delivering a memorable and authentic tribute show. The band recreates the energetic and dynamic performances that made Shania Twain a global superstar. They faithfully reproduce her greatest hits, including chart-toppers like &#8220;Man! I Feel Like a Woman,&#8221; &#8220;That Don&#8217;t Impress Me Much,&#8221; &#8220;You&#8217;re Still the One,&#8221; and many more. The show captures the essence of Shania Twain&#8217;s music, combining catchy melodies, heartfelt lyrics, and infectious pop-infused country sounds. Donna Huber, as &#8220;Shania Twin,&#8221; resembles the beloved singer, from her stunning stage presence to her distinctive vocal style. She flawlessly channels Shania Twain&#8217;s powerful voice, captivating the audience with her range, emotion, and charisma. Donna&#8217;s attention to detail in emulating Shania&#8217;s mannerisms, fashion sense, and signature stage performances adds an extra layer of authenticity to the tribute.\nAccompanied by a talented group of musicians, the Shania Twain tribute band recreates the live concert experience with high-energy performances, engaging choreography, and visually captivating stage production. The band strives to create an immersive atmosphere, ensuring that fans of Shania Twain feel transported to her original concerts.\nWhether performing at festivals, corporate events, private parties, or dedicated concert venues, the Shania Twain tribute band starring Donna Huber as &#8220;Shania Twin&#8221; brings the joy, nostalgia, and excitement of Shania Twain&#8217;s music to audiences around the world. Her dedication to honoring Shania&#8217;s legacy provides an unforgettable entertainment experience that allows fans to relive the magic of the original artist&#8217;s performances.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
