    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Retired prison guard Doris Mooney has just moved into Paradise Village, a retirement home in Canmore, Alberta. She quickly befriends Ivy Hoffbauer, a former world champion skier who&#8217;s taken aback by Doris&#8217;s cheerful brashness. Rounding out the trio is dapper Arthur Beech who has designs on Ivy. Love, gossip and sex behind the compost heap, this is Foster at his hilarious best.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
