        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<strong>Norfolk Economic Development</strong> is thrilled to invite you to a special business networking event on <strong>October 7th, 2024</strong>. Co-presented in partnership with the <strong>Lighthouse Festival</strong>, this evening promises to be a unique opportunity to connect with local business leaders, exchange ideas, and foster new relationships.\nWhether you are an established business owner, an aspiring entrepreneur, or a community leader, this event offers the perfect setting to expand your network, share your experiences, and gain valuable insights. Together, we can strengthen our business community and create new opportunities for inclusion, growth, and collaboration.\nCo-presented by <strong>Lighthouse Festival</strong> and <strong>Norfolk Economic Development</strong>.\nFor more information, please visit <a href=https://norfolkbusiness.ca/better-together/>https://norfolkbusiness.ca/better-together/</a>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
