    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Cinderella – The Panto: where glass slippers meet pumpkin chariots, and a Fairy Godmother moonlights as a life coach for mice. In this whimsical spectacle, the clock strikes midnight, but not before Cinderella swaps her ballgown for some tattered rags and her tiara for a scrunchie. The Ugly Stepsisters compete in a high-stakes dance-off, and the Prince insists on using a rudimentary GPS to find the mysterious shoe owner. With talking mice, disco balls, and a pumpkin spice carriage, this pantomime proves that happily ever after is just a glitter bomb away!\n<a href=https://lighthousetheatre.com/tickets/>Click here for full details on ticket pricing by location.</a>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
