        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Elvis &#8211; A Christmas Special with Pete Paquette\nReturning this Holiday season, the incredible showman, Pete Paquette, and his band, the Rockin&#8217; Royals with the sensational Tonettes, brings you Elvis &#8211; A Christmas Special\nBest known for his portrayal as Elvis Presley, Pete takes the stage to celebrate the Christmas Holidays through a special Tribute performance of the King’s greatest Christmas Carols and songs of inspiration such as: « Blue Christmas », « Here Comes Santa Claus », « O Come, All Ye Faithful », « The Wonderful World of Christmas », and many more traditional Christmas favourites.\nWith the entire Christmas song book at their disposal, Pete will take you on a magical journey and sing a variety of some of his personal favourite Christmas songs that are dear to his heart.\nDon’t miss this heartwarming show this Holiday Season. « Elvis &#8211; A Christmas Special », a joyous event that will sure inspire the Christmas spirit in everyone! We will have a ‘Blue Christmas’ without you.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
