      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "🍀 <strong>Get Your Green On at Lighthouse Festival Theatre&#8217;s St. Patrick’s Day Party!</strong> 🍀\nJoin us for a shamrockin’ good time featuring live music by <i>The Old Barn Doors</i>! They&#8217;ll have you toe-tapping to St. Patrick’s Day classics and their own lively originals. Bid on treasures at our Irish-themed silent auction, sip on green beer, and indulge in mouth-watering food that’ll make you say, Erin go Bragh! Don’t forget to hit the dance floor – jigging skills optional but highly encouraged.\nPut on your best green and bring your Irish spirit (real or honorary) – it’s the pot of gold at the end of your March rainbow! 🎶🍻🎉\n<p style=font-weight: 400;>19+ Event – Bag check policy in effect.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
