      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p style=font-weight: 400;>While the King is away, the people of England suffer under the oppressive rule of his tax-happy brother, Prince John. Only a straight arrow like Robin Hood, the best archer in the land, can save England! By stealing from the rich and giving back to the poor, Robin keeps the spirit of justice alive, with the help of a few friends along the way, including Maid Marian, Friar Tuck, and Little John. But what if the Prince and the dreaded Sheriff of Nottingham lay a trap for our hero? With all the humour and fun people have come to expect, DuffleBag hits the mark with this on-target tale of derring-do!\n"
      }
    ]
  },
