    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Bowie Lives returns to the Roselawn Theatre for one unforgettable night. &#8220;5 Stars!&#8221; says Richard Crouse host of CTV PopLife. With the addition of new costumes and songs, this year&#8217;s staging has been electrifying audiences far and wide. &#8220;The Bowie Lives&#8221; is a dynamic tribute band dedicated to celebrating the music and legacy of David Bowie. With Michael Bell, an award-winning vocalist, leading the show and an all-star band, the performance captures the essence of Bowie&#8217;s sound, style, and stage presence. The show offers a theatrical experience, complete with costumes, multimedia elements, and a setlist that spans Bowie&#8217;s extensive career—from Space Oddity to Lazarus. The show is renowned for its authenticity, with Bell&#8217;s vocal delivery often compared to Bowie himself. More info at <a class=ms-outlook-linkify href=http://www.thebowielives.com/ data-ogsc=>www.thebowielives.com</a>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
