        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<span data-teams=true><span class=ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak dir=ltr>Like you&#8217;ve never seen before, this brand new twist on the classic tale of the Baskervilles takes us on a whole new journey of murderous laughter. When Sir Charles is found dead, the great detective Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson must leave Baker Street to unravel the mysteries surrounding his death and investigate the curse of the Hound of the Baskervilles. A sublimely funny adaptation of a classic where 3 actors play 17 characters, leaving the audience barking with laughter.</span></span>\n<strong>Please Note: This production contains the use of fog in the Port Dover theatre only.</strong>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
