    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p style=font-weight: 400;>Get ready for a fresh, fun twist on a classic fairytale with Lighthouse Festival&#8217;s 2025 Young Company production of <strong>Snow White</strong>! Sure, you know the story: a sweet princess, a jealous queen, a magic mirror with sass to spare, and seven dwarfs who’ve never heard of Windex®, Pledge®, or a Swiffer®. This time, our Young Company is bringing their own hilarious energy to the tale, making it a one-of-a-kind show!\n<p style=font-weight: 400;>Watch Snow White dodge poisoned apples, win over grumpy dwarfs, and somehow make living in the forest with seven strangers seem like a sensible life choice. The evil queen is still trying to be the fairest of them all, but honestly, with her dramatic flair, she might just win &#8220;Biggest Diva&#8221; instead. And of course, there&#8217;s a prince—because what&#8217;s a fairytale without someone dramatically riding in at the last second?\n<p style=font-weight: 400;>Packed with laughs, quirky characters, and enough charm to make you forget how odd it is to hang out with woodland creatures, <em>Snow White</em> is a rollicking good time for the whole family. You&#8217;ll cheer, you&#8217;ll laugh, and you might just leave craving an apple… just be sure to check with the mirror first!\n"
      }
    ]
  },
