    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Angel Morgan’s Spirit Box: The Psychic Experience"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Halloween&#8217;s Hottest Ticket In Town!!!!\nAngel Morgan celebrates the Day Of The Dead with an exciting and hair-raising experience that takes you on a real life journey over to the other side of the cemetery! Join her as she brings through messages from loved ones and then takes it one&#8230;step&#8230;further&#8230;She uses a SPIRIT BOX to compel spirits to use their voices and be heard on this side!\nAnd don&#8217;t forget to buy your ticket while they last for the after show adventure! A paranormal seance that will hold so many surprises! Let Angel and her guest paranormal team bring through messages as they use a varied paranormal equipment along the way to validate for audiences the authenticity of their experiences!\nTradition meets technology… The choice is yours.\n&nbsp;\nWhat if you could hear your loved ones one more time?\nWhat if there was no wall between the worlds.\nWhat if for just one moment&#8230;the other side&#8230;was real?\nThe Spirit Box will open the gates, and open the way&#8230;&#8230;\nWill you cross over?\n&nbsp;\n<strong>VIP Ticket Includes: </strong>\nSeats within the first two rows of the theatre for the show\nSeating on stage with Angel for the 45-minute post-show séance\n"
      }
    ]
  },
