    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Johnny Max’s A Bluesy Christmas with Chuck Jackson &amp; Cheryl Lescom\nImagine all of your favourite Christmas songs, and a few other ones that you may or may not know, being sung by some of Canada’s favourite Blues voices!\nA Bluesy Christmas is a Bluesified version of all of your favourite Christmas tunes. From Merry Christmas, Baby to Rudolph the Red Nosed Reindeer to Santa Claus is Coming to Town to Christmas Time in New Orleans.\nIt’s all here with an All Star band bringing you all the nuances and style of the originals\nAgain, songs that you know by Ray Charles, Bonnie Raitt, Albert King and Louis Armstrong, it’s all here!\nFriends, Chuck Jackson( lead singer of The Downchild Blues Band) &amp; Johnny Max ( 2 X JUNO Award nominee) got together with their pal and one of Canada’s finest female vocalists, Cheryl Lescom( Ronnie Hawkins &amp; Matt MInglewood), had an idea to bring a show to their home of Port Credit and it has blossomed form there.\nYou know all of the songs and will laugh at all of the banter from these close friends.\nA great night of Christmas music sung and played to perfection by these consummate professionals, all on one stage!!\nIt’s all candy canes and chocolate when you come and experience A Bluesy Christmas\n"
      }
    ]
  },
