      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<strong>Experience the timeless music that has become the soundtrack to the holidays for generations.</strong>\nThe Glenn Paul Trio captures the spirit of Vince Guaraldi’s iconic 1965 album with authenticity and reverence. This is more than a concert—it’s a nostalgic journey back to living-room floors, crackling records, and the wide-eyed wonder of childhood.\nWith 10 sold-out shows across Southern Ontario in 2024, this performance has quickly become a cherished holiday tradition for jazz lovers, families, and anyone who holds <i>A Charlie Brown Christmas</i> close to their heart.\nCelebrate the season with class, charm, and just the right touch of holiday cheer.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
