    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TIME WARP PROMOTIONS PRESENTS:\nHELLS BELLS\nSince their electrifying inception in 1994 in the heart of Toronto, Hells Bells has soared to become the world’s longest-touring tribute to the legendary AC/DC, lighting up stages across North America with unstoppable passion and excitement.\nDon’t miss your chance to experience Hells Bells—a tribute that not only honours but revives the spirit of AC/DC. Join us for a night where the music is contagious, and the memories are unforgettable.\nAll Ages! Family friendly!\nGet ready to rock like never before!\n<a id=menur2lq5 class=fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn title=https://youtu.be/is8qbxfc2wi href=https://youtu.be/Is8qBXfc2WI target=_blank rel=noreferrer noopener aria-label=Link https://youtu.be/Is8qBXfc2WI>https://youtu.be/Is8qBXfc2WI </a>\n<a id=menur2lq8 class=fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn title=https://www.hellsbellscanada.com/ href=https://www.hellsbellscanada.com target=_blank rel=noreferrer noopener aria-label=Link https://www.hellsbellscanada.com>https://www.hellsbellscanada.com</a>\n"
      }
    ]
