        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "OutShout Entertainment proudly presents A Singer&#8217;s Series, showcasing MB: The Songs of Michael Bublé and HELLO: A Tribute to Adele—two incredible shows in one unforgettable evening!\nMB stars award-winning vocalist and Canadian singing sensation Michael Bell. Known for his acclaimed theatre production The Bowie Lives, Michael now brings his charm and talent to the timeless songs of Michael Bublé and other classics. &#8220;A Class Act. A Real Crooner,&#8221; raves The Toronto Star.\nOutShout is also thrilled to introduce Lizeh Basciano, performing A Tribute to Adele. Lizeh, a gifted artist with both covers and original works, delivers an uncanny rendition of Adele&#8217;s signature sound. Her debut album, Ordinary Girl, is available on major streaming platforms.\nThe evening will be accompanied by the lush sounds of the MB Orchestra, led by veteran instrumentalist and arranger Dan Douglas. Prepare for an enchanting night filled with some of the world’s most romantic melodies!\n"
      }
    ]
  },
