    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://lighthousetheatre.com/event/blue-suede-and-rhinestones/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Blue Suede and Rhinestones"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&#8220;Blue Suede and Rhinestones,-a remarkable musical journey celebrating the timeless sounds of Dolly Parton and Elvis Presley. Starring award-winning Elvis tribute artist Bruno Nesci and the captivating Daphne Moens, this electrifying show brings together the best of country and rock &#8216;n&#8217; roll.\nBruno Nesci, a multi-award-winning Elvis tribute artist, has consistently secured a top spot in the Ultimate Elvis Contest in Memphis, Tennessee, for four consecutive years—achieving a feat no other Canadian has. With unparalleled dedication, Bruno captures Elvis&#8217;s essence, showcasing the voice, look, and charisma that defined the King.\nJoining Bruno is Daphne Moens, a powerhouse vocalist with a wealth of experience, having performed globally, in musicals such as Rock of Ages, Footloose, Freaky Friday, and Legally Blonde, as well as a featured performer for Royal Caribbean Cruise Lines. Daphne doesn&#8217;t just perform Dolly Parton&#8217;s songs—she becomes Dolly. With charm and glamour, Daphne takes audiences on a journey through Dolly&#8217;s greatest hits, leaving them with a renewed appreciation for the magic of country music.\nBacked by a live band, &#8220;Blue Suede and Rhinestones&#8221; authentically recreates the legendary performances of Elvis and Dolly. Meticulously crafted costumes, infectious energy, and the undeniable chemistry between Bruno and Daphne create an unforgettable experience for all.\nWhether you&#8217;re a devoted fan or seeking a night of entertainment, &#8220;Blue Suede and Rhinestones&#8221; promises an immersive celebration of musical icons. Don&#8217;t miss this chance to witness the magic of Elvis and Dolly come alive on stage. &#8220;Blue Suede and Rhinestones&#8221; promises an immersive celebration of two icons that changed the world of music forever!\n"
      }
    ]
  },
