        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Step into the world of a true Canadian icon with GORD&#8217;S GOLD.  An unforgettable tribute to the legendary Gordon Lightfoot.\nRelive the magic of timeless classics like If You Could Read My Mind, Sundown, and The Wreck of the Edmund Fitzgerald. This heartfelt and respectful show captures the essence of Lightfoot’s storytelling and musical genius, bringing his greatest hits to life in an intimate setting.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
