    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<i>Neo Young</i>, considered by many as Canada’s top Neil Young tribute act, returns to the stage solo with a music and visual biography of Neil’s life and songs. <i>Neo</i> tastefully revisits the music of Neil Young with an authentic yet reminiscent interpretation of all the acoustic classics.\nJoining Neo for this show will be pedal steel guitar player Jeff Goldberg, fiddler Jimmy Young, and bassist Thomas Nelson of the Thomas Nelson Band.\nReviews:\n<ul>\n<li><i>You&#8217;ll believe Neil is in the room. A great show, a great show indeed.&#8221;</i></li>\n<li><i>&#8220;It was a great night out! Great to listen to Neil Young music and back stories&#8221;</i></li>\n<li><i>This is one of the best tribute bands I&#8217;ve ever seen.</i></li>\n<li><i>Keeping it real. great sound. definitely no parrot.</i></li>\n<li><i>It’s not just donning the costume and hitting the notes perfectly, there’s a sense that when you see Gary Pooler with his sunglasses on with Neil’s gait and posture that he is Neil. Even when introducing songs, Neo channels Neil’s off-the-cuff style. and shares the same mumbled, folksy way that Neil has. (Niagara This Week)</i></li>\n</ul>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
