    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://lighthousetheatre.com/event/epic-eagles-the-definitive-eagles-tribute/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Epic Eagles &#8211; The Definitive Eagles Tribute"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EPIC <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>EAGLES</span> &#8211; The Definitive <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles </span>Tribute\nProviding a masterful presentation of <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span>classic hits and Don Henley favourites with its rock n’ roll game-changing song catalogue. Epic <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span> has earned its place among the top drawing <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span> tribute acts in North America and is widely regarded as the finest <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span> tribute show in production today.\nPerfecting the music while sharing incredible lead vocal similarity, audiences are treated to a high energy show with the legacy sound of the <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span> and Don Henley.\nThe show features greatest hits like Hotel California, One of These Nights, Life in the Fast Lane, Desperado, Dirty Laundry, New Kid in Town, Take it Easy, The Boys of Summer along with some deep cuts for the die-hard <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span> &amp; Henley fans.\nJourney through all the <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span>’ signature sounds, from country rock to hard rocking tunes highlighting their extraordinary catalogue, with lush vocal harmonies and exceptional musical accuracy.\nEpic <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span> have had the privilege of sharing the stage with 54-40, Brothers Osborne, Chris Janson, Joe Nichols, Randy Houser; and during his almost 2-decade tenure with his previous band HC (the original) as their Henley, Dean Young (born/raised in Port Colborne) had the privilege of sharing the stage with REO Speedwagon, Styx, 38 Special, John Anderson, Gretchen Wilson, Collective Soul, Train, Jewel, Smithereens, Jim Cuddy Band.\nDean’s uncanny similarity to Don Henley has garnered rave reviews worldwide (Japan, Bermuda, Barbados, and North America)\nWhether you’re a die-hard <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span> / Henley fan or new to their music, Epic <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Eagles</span> high-energy and interactive all-ages show will leave you wanting more!\nYou can check out anytime you like but you can never leave….\n"
      }
    ]
  },
