    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Cruise with us on a nostalgic journey with faithful renditions of the iconic smooth rock sounds of the mid 70s &amp; 80s that defined a generation. Experience an unforgettable musical voyage at this Yacht Rock party—with lush harmonies and smooth grooves, The Yacht Rock Show performs classic hits from artists that shaped the genre, including: Toto, Styx, Michael McDonald, Christopher Cross, Kenny Loggins, The Doobie Brothers, Boz Scaggs, Gerry Rafferty, Steely Dan, Player, Little River Band, Ambrosia and more. Wear your best Yacht Rock attire!\nTHE YACHT ROCK SHOW performs iconic Smooth Classic Rock from the 70s &amp; 80s with note-for-note renditions of quintessential nostalgic hits that created an era of music that influenced a generation.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
