    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "STEP INTO THE DECADE THAT CHANGED EVERYTHING.\n80’s Confidential is a high-energy, multi-artist tribute concert celebrating the unforgettable sound, style, and attitude of the 1980s. This is not a single-band tribute — it’s a fast-moving theatrical concert experience that brings the decade’s biggest hits, one-hit wonders, and iconic moments together on one stage with an amazing light and video show.\nPerformed live by a powerhouse band featuring male and female lead vocals, saxophone, soaring guitars, and authentic 80s synth textures, the show delivers hit after hit with no filler — the songs you forgot you loved, and the ones you never stopped loving.\nFrom high-energy anthems to unforgettable sing-along moments, 80’s Confidential is a shared celebration of a decade when music was bold, emotional, and larger than life.\nWhether you lived it the first time or are discovering it for the first time, this is your invitation to dance, sing, and relive the magic.\nOne night. One decade. All the hits.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
