        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "FLEETWOOD MAC &amp; TOM PETTY!\nAN EXCLUSIVE 2 BAND CELEBRATION.\nNorth America’s Top Fleetwood Mac Tribute\nA visually and musically stunning performance featuring the renowned Fleetwood Nicks. All the hits of Fleetwood Mac PLUS the solo work of Stevie Nicks performed flawlessly to the last detail – including full costume and instrumentation! AND as a special bonus, you’ll be treated to the hits of Stevie Nicks with special guest Tom Petty!!!\nNorth America’s Top Tribute to Tom Petty\nTake in the sights and sounds of Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers in all their glory. Performing to sold-out crowds across Canada and the U.S., Practically Petty is the band most preferred by Tom Petty music lovers. Capturing the essence of the Tom Petty look and swagger complete with authentic Rickenbacker guitars and flamboyant outfits.\nA dynamic ONE-TWO performance you don’t want to miss, and you won’t soon forget.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
