    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Something Is Happening. The Bob Dylan Tribute"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Legends Revisited Presents\nSomething Is Happening. The Bob Dylan Tribute.\nBob Dylan is anything but A COMPLETE UNKNOWN. His famously shape shifting career is unique in modern music. Each milestone an Era.   And each era introducing the world to a different artistic identity.\nIn this transformational and historically accurate live concert presentation, Virgil Kinsley and His Band will take you on a musical journey through Bob Dylan’s illustrious career &#8211; note for note and Era by Era.\nCritically Acclaimed and Universally Celebrated.\nThe Early Folk &amp; Protest Era (1961–1964) Acoustic guitar, harmonica. The legend begins.\nThe Electric Rock Era (1965–1966) The infamous Judas! moment in Manchester when he plugged in.\nThe Country &amp; Americana Era (1967–1969) A motorcycle accident sparks a gentler sound.\nThe 1970s Renaissance Era (1970–1979) A mix of personal, political, and poetic work.\nThe Christian / Gospel Era (1979–1981) Dylan becomes a born again Christian.\nThe 1980s Experimentation Era (1982–1989) New directions and supergroup The Traveling Wilburys.\nThe Late Career Revival Era (1997–present) A Grammy win with ‘Time Out of Mind’.\nThe Never Ending Tour Era (1988–2024) Performing constantly, reinventing his songs every night.\nEnjoy this magical, musical and multimedia masterpiece that is The Bob Dylan Experience. It’s sure to be a concert for the ages &#8211; and the Eras.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://lighthousetheatre.com/event/curtains-2026-community-show/",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#locale": [
