        "@value": "Curtains - 2026 Community Show - Lighthouse Festival %"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Curtains is a side-splitting Broadway musical comedy where murder meets musical theatre – and the result is pure showbiz gold. Set in 1959 Boston, the story begins on the opening night of a brand-new (and not-so-brilliant) musical called Robbin’ Hood. When the show’s talentless leading lady drops dead mid-bow, it’s up to the charmingly awkward Detective Frank Cioffi, a cop with Broadway dreams of his own, to solve the case before the killer strikes again."
      }
    ],
