        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "🎸 Run 2 You: The Bryan Adams Experience – A Night of Iconic Hits &amp; Unforgettable Memories!\nAre you ready to go back in time on a high-energy musical journey through the legendary sounds of Bryan Adams? Run 2 You brings the heart and soul of Bryan’s iconic hits to life, delivering a show that captures the passion and power of one of the greatest Canadian rock musicians of all time.\nWith powerhouse vocals and an electrifying stage presence, Run 2 You faithfully recreates the Bryan Adams experience. Fans will be transported back to the 80s and 90s with all the classics, from &#8220;Summer of &#8217;69&#8221; to &#8220;Everything I Do (I Do It for You)&#8221; and &#8220;Run to You.&#8221;\n"
      }
    ]
  },
