    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Classic <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Lightfoot</span> Live stands as Canada’s premier homage to the legendary folk rocker, Gordon <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Lightfoot</span>. Led by the remarkable ensemble of music director and bassist Bob Doidge (Gord’s record producer), bassist Steve Eyers(Gord’s nephew), lead guitarist Eric Kidd, and lead vocalist and guitarist John Stinson, l this show whisks you down a nostalgic journey through <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Lightfoot</span>’s iconic music.\nFounded in 2012 by lead vocalist, John Stinson, a long time Ontario musician. John has been entertaining audiences around Ontario for over 30 years. He has been widely praised for his uncanny sonic resemblance to Gord, and his attention to replicating Gord’s original studio recordings. John was trained and mentored to play Gordon <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Lightfoot</span> music by the legendary <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Lightfoot</span> lead guitarist, Red Shea.\nPlaying 6 and 12 string guitars, just like Gord, John is backed by the CLASSIC <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>LIGHTFOOT</span> LIVE band, this stellar cast of seasoned musicians  delivers an infectiously enthusiastic and historically inspired show. If you are looking to experience all the sentimental and emotional music of <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Lightfoot</span>’s songs, look no further than Classic <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Lightfoot</span> Live. Each band member has been influenced by <span class=outlook-search-highlight data-markjs=true>Lightfoot</span>’s music and the passion comes through in every performance.\n"
