    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The boxes are all packed, and sisters Blanche and Stella are ready to take their mother to her new nursing home. There’s just one problem – mom won’t go. She still has a few skeletons in the closet, and she’s not leaving her house until she’s said her piece. While the sisters bicker about what to do, their mother shouts zingers out her bedroom window, revealing long-buried family secrets that will change their lives forever.\nYour health and safety is a priority when visiting our venues.<a href=https://lighthousetheatre.com/covid/> Click here to see our COVID-19 Duty of Care. </a>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
