    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A blockbuster live concert featuring music from those legendary artists who got their start at California’s famous Troubadour Club — The Eagles, Bruce Springsteen, Elton John, Neil Diamond, James Taylor, Jackson Browne, Linda Ronstadt, Carole King, Carly Simon, Van Morrison, Cat Stevens, Gordon Lightfoot, Joni Mitchell, and more. Fabulous singers backed by a dynamite live band perform this cavalcade of hits that has been described as dynamic and sensational. GLORY DAYS! is an incredible musical night to remember!\nYour health and safety is a priority when visiting our venues.<a href=https://lighthousetheatre.com/covid/> Click here to see our COVID-19 Duty of Care. </a>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
