    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Meet Pinocchio, the enchanting wooden puppet with dreams as big as his heart! Carved by the kind toymaker Geppetto, Pinocchio embarks on whimsical adventures, accompanied by his trusty conscience, Jiminy Cricket. But here’s the twist – his nose grows when he fibs! From the lively streets of his village to the magical wonders of Pleasure Island, Pinocchio learns valuable lessons about honesty and friendship. With a sprinkle of fairy dust and a pinch of laughter, Pinocchio shows that being true to yourself makes for the best story. So, gather ’round for a tale filled with joy, courage, and the magic of becoming a real boy!\n<em>Young Company features youth ages 11-17 who have participated in our three-week summer theatre program learning the behind the scenes magic of creating live theatre. Visit lighthousetheatre.com/young-company for participation and registration.</em>\n&nbsp;\n"
      }
    ]
